= Secure the Evidence

If the Chancellor moves against us, the evidence must survive.

- @do: Secure the Evidence.
- @easy_discard

@do
on-arrival: evidence += 1; free_press += 0.5

Copies of the Caucus dossier are sent to Alderaan, Chandrila and an independent HoloNet station. If we fall, the truth will not.
